# Security headers for all routes (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages format).
#
# Notes:
# - frame-ancestors 'none' / X-Frame-Options DENY: nothing legitimate embeds
#   StudySync in an iframe; this blocks clickjacking. The Jitsi lesson room is
#   the OTHER direction (we embed 8x8.vc) and is unaffected.
# - Permissions-Policy grants camera/mic to self and 8x8.vc so the embedded
#   Jitsi lesson iframe keeps working.
# - No enforced Content-Security-Policy yet: the app loads Supabase, Google
#   Fonts, Jitsi, payment providers and inline JSON-LD; an untested strict CSP
#   would risk breaking production. Start with Report-Only in future work.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self "https://8x8.vc"), microphone=(self "https://8x8.vc"), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
